# Strict allowlist: ignore everything by default, then re-allow only the
# frontend paths that belong in the public repo. New folders/files added at
# the repo root will be ignored automatically until explicitly allowed here.

/*

# Allowed top-level files
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/README.md

# Allowed top-level folders (recurse into them)
!/assets/
!/css/
!/js/
